# This directory contains evidence files generated by the lab validation scripts.
# Evidence files are generated at runtime — they are NOT committed to the repository.
# Run `scripts/setup.bat evidence` (Windows) or `./scripts/setup.sh evidence` (Linux/macOS)
# to generate all evidence files after starting the Docker containers.
#
# Expected files after running evidence generation:
#   vulnerable_server_boot.txt      — container startup log for Apache 2.4.49
#   validate_traversal_output.txt   — path traversal validator output (pre-patch)
#   validate_cgi_output.txt         — CGI handler validator output (pre-patch)
#   detection_pre_patch.txt         — detect_cve.py output against 2.4.49 (VULNERABLE)
#   patched_server_boot.txt         — container startup log for Apache 2.4.51
#   validate_post_patch.txt         — all validators output against 2.4.51 (PATCHED)
#   detection_post_patch.txt        — detect_cve.py output against 2.4.51 (SECURE)
#   detection_pre_patch.json        — JSON report from detect_cve.py (pre-patch)
#   detection_post_patch.json       — JSON report from detect_cve.py (post-patch)
